# Git workflow

Edmund is the sole contributor. Do not invent PR/review process.

- This directory stays on `dev`. For real work, `./scripts/worktree add <slug>` and edit in `../stage-wand-trees/…`. Never `git switch` this folder off `dev`.
- Never commit to `main`. Land features by merging into `dev` when asked. Promote `dev` → `main` only when asked to ship. Hotfixes are `hotfix/*` from `main`, merged into `dev` too.
- One branch per worktree. No force-push of `main` or `dev`. No GitHub PR unless he asks.
